  "description": "When Banya, the Leaguemaster of the Thousand Malice League, chose Youngso Baekli of the righteous path as his bride, it was supposed to buy ten years of peace. But while his death at her hands risked that peace, the greatest threat proved to be his return to life three years later. Desperate to convince Banya that she didn’t curse him, the couple soon ends up entering a bargain with the Queen Mother herself. With her soul on the line, all that remains is the question: Is redemption possible?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
